extends ui_layout

block styles
  link(type='text/css', rel='stylesheet', href='/public/css/com.css')

block content
  .sixteen.wide.column.centered#com
    .ui.card
      .com-header
        h1 New User Community Training
      .com-content
          p To help new users engage constructively, FreshView runs a <strong>short community training</strong> before you enter the main feed. You'll be shown an example post similar to what you might encounter on any social media platform, and you'll practice responding as a thoughtful community member.
          p Throughout the process, our <strong>AI community assistant</strong> will be available to offer guidance. You can share your draft responses, ask for suggestions, or discuss any concerns with it. You're always free to respond however you see fit.
          p Once you've posted your final comment or fully engaged with the assistant, you'll be able to enter the main feed and interact with real users.
          p When you're ready, press <strong>Start</strong> to begin.
      .com-footer
        .com-footer-content
          img.com-logo(src='/public/favicon.svg', alt='<strong style="color: black;">FreshView</strong> Logo')
          .com-enter
            a.ui.large.primary.button(href='/training_module') Start